IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMP3-DEMO.
       AUTHOR. VALIDATION-PLATFORM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PACKED-1       PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 12345.67.
       01  WS-PACKED-2       PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3 VALUE -987.65.
       01  WS-PACKED-3       PIC 9(4)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 100.00.
       01  WS-RESULT         PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "COMP-3 DEMO STARTED".
           DISPLAY "WS-PACKED-1=" WS-PACKED-1.
           DISPLAY "WS-PACKED-2=" WS-PACKED-2.
           DISPLAY "WS-PACKED-3=" WS-PACKED-3.

           ADD WS-PACKED-1 TO WS-PACKED-2 GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "ADD PACKED-1 TO PACKED-2 RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           SUBTRACT WS-PACKED-2 FROM WS-PACKED-1 GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "SUBTRACT PACKED-2 FROM PACKED-1 RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           MULTIPLY WS-PACKED-3 BY 2 GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "MULTIPLY PACKED-3 BY 2 RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           DIVIDE WS-PACKED-1 BY 100 GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "DIVIDE PACKED-1 BY 100 RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           STOP RUN.